ation founded in 1967 and, as such, has significant experience, long-standing relationships and extensive knowledge of its core markets, submarkets and asset classes. American Assets Trust, Inc. is headquartered in San Diego, California. American Assets Trust, Inc. was incorporated in 1967 in Maryland and based in San Diego, California."}}